														<r3d:remarks>João Pedro de Magalhães is the principal investigator of the Integrative Genomics of Ageing Group at the University of Liverpool in the UK. Amongst other projects, we maintain the Human Ageing Genomic Resources, a series of tools and databases aimed at understanding the genetic basis of human aging.
Grants from: https://genomics.senescence.info/about.html
Databases: The Ageing Gene Database (GenAge), The Dietary Restriction Database (GenDR), Human Longevity Genetic Variants Database (LongevityMap), The Animal Ageing and Longevity Database (AnAge). Projects: Gene Expression, Cancer, Genome Sequencing, Evolution of Ageing</r3d:remarks>
